# The SMK-37 build: the screen says what to press without a manual. The knob row names its knobs (K5..K8); the four
# buttons the FM-1 has not (KNOB BANK, FADER BANK, <, >) act on release and, held alone a second, show their help card
# (card = NB + 1 + SB_*: 15..18) and their release then does nothing. The simulator fails on a card's words past its box.
wait 300
shot home_knobs.png
# ---- KNOB BANK: tapped, the pads' map; held, its card (and the map stays as it was)
sbtn KNOB_BANK
expect smkmap 1
sbtn KNOB_BANK
expect smkmap 0
sbtn KNOB_BANK down
wait 1100
expect card 15
shot card_knob_bank.png
sbtn KNOB_BANK up
wait 50
expect card 0
expect smkmap 0
# ---- FADER BANK: held, its card; the bank unchanged
expect fbank 0
sbtn FADER_BANK down
wait 1100
expect card 16
shot card_fader_bank.png
sbtn FADER_BANK up
wait 50
expect card 0
expect fbank 0
sbtn FADER_BANK
expect fbank 1
# ---- < and >: held, their cards; tapped, a page
sbtn LEFT down
wait 1100
expect card 17
shot card_left.png
sbtn LEFT up
wait 50
expect card 0
expect page 0
sbtn RIGHT down
wait 1100
expect card 18
shot card_right.png
sbtn RIGHT up
wait 50
expect card 0
expect page 0
# ---- Setup and Status: the knobs named, the theme on K5
tap GLO
expect page 15
shot setup_knobs.png
sbtn RIGHT
expect page 16
expect knobs_shown 1
shot status_theme.png
